AUTOMATION: Bug fix. Batch arg handling should JSON.stringify objects before passing to handlers. Spec @batch-exec.
[2026-02-23T16:32:12.551Z] @claude:
Added toArgString() helper in batch-exec.ts that JSON.stringify objects instead of using String() which produces [object Object]. Fix applied to all 4 value-serialization paths in buildCommandArgv (positional scalars, positional array items, option scalars, option array items). 3 unit tests + 1 integration test with real task patch through batch. All 3229 tests pass.
